header><strong class=3D"style_chapter__grtAe">02</strong><h1>Visual Search =
System</h1></header><p>A system helps users discover images that are visual=
ly similar to a selected image. In this chapter, we design a visual search =
system similar to Pinterest=E2=80=99s [1] [2].</p>
