in-right: 0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span> nearest points. The tim=
e complexity is <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xm=
lns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo s=
